  "description": "The sidebar quick-jump overlay with a live query. Its meaning widened with the Full Search page: the overlay now opens on ANY query text rather than only on a query with hits, and it leads with a pinned 'Open Full Search for \"r\"' row that is the default selection — so Enter goes to the full page and the top hit becomes ArrowDown-then-Enter. Below the pinned row the familiar capped list still shows: Groups, Grouped URLs split per group, and Archived URLs with a highlighted notes snippet. This scenario is the before-half of the feature's story, the state a user is in at the moment they decide ten results are not enough.",
